 794:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c **** /**
 795:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   * @brief  Enables or disables the SDIO interrupts.
 796:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   * @param  SDIO_IT: specifies the SDIO interrupt sources to be enabled or disabled.
 797:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *          This parameter can be one or a combination of the following values:
 798:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_CCRCFAIL: Command response received (CRC check failed) interrupt
 799:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_DCRCFAIL: Data block sent/received (CRC check failed) interrupt
 800:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_CTIMEOUT: Command response timeout interrupt
 801:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_DTIMEOUT: Data timeout interrupt
 802:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_TXUNDERR: Transmit FIFO underrun error interrupt
 803:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_RXOVERR:  Received FIFO overrun error interrupt
 804:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_CMDREND:  Command response received (CRC check passed) interrupt
