 972:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_CCRCFAIL: Command response received (CRC check failed) interrupt
 973:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_DCRCFAIL: Data block sent/received (CRC check failed) interrupt
 974:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_CTIMEOUT: Command response timeout interrupt
 975:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_sdio.c ****   *            @arg SDIO_IT_DTIMEOUT: Data timeout interrupt
